      "tabname": "Details",
      "views": [
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**Keeps your car's speakers in high quality while Camera is recording**, instead of dropping to phone-call quality the moment a microphone is needed too.\n\nA first release, and its own package — CarPlay has nothing to do with the social apps the combined Albrhi package patches.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 12
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Beta"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Written and checked against `tools/check.py`, but not yet run on a real phone in a real car. Treat the first install as the test.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "The problem",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "CarPlay audio is playing over your car's speakers. Camera opens, recording starts, and the music suddenly sounds like a phone call — because the instant a microphone is needed too, iOS drops Bluetooth to the phone-call profile, the only one that carries both directions at once.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "The fix",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Output and input are asked for separately: the car's speakers stay on the high-quality profile, and the recording uses the iPhone's own microphone instead of sharing the car's. Both are ordinary, documented AVAudioSession settings — nothing here reads or changes anything about the call itself.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Not yet included",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "This is a first release. Showing other apps on the CarPlay screen, wallpapers and themes are being built next, carefully and on a real device — none of it is in this version.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Its own package",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "CarPlay has nothing to do with the social apps Albrhi patches, so it ships and updates on its own instead of inside the combined package.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        }
      ]
    },
